# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Vite
.vite/

# Playwright (Phase 2+)
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Game content documents — DELIBERATELY NOT COMMITTED.
#
# The rulebook, quick reference and study packet are Kartik's design work. This repository is
# PUBLIC, and docs/PHASE1_BRIEF.md holds the game-content licence pending an assets-provenance
# check — so committing these would publish them under no licence at all.
#
# Ignored rather than merely left untracked, on purpose: untracked is one careless `git add -A`
# away from publication, and that has already happened once in this repo. The rule is written
# down so it does not depend on anyone remembering it.
#
# To publish them, resolve the content licence first (docs/LICENSES.md), then remove this rule
# in the same commit that records the decision.
docs/*.docx

# Coverage output
coverage/

# CI output, written into the working tree by the workflows and by anyone running the same
# commands locally. Ignored rather than merely untracked, on the rule the docx entry above uses:
# untracked is one careless `git add -A` away from being committed, and that has happened here.
#   results/  one JSON per suite, written by tools/ci/record-result.ts
#   site/     the built dashboard, uploaded to Pages and never committed to main
#   history/  the accumulated records, fetched from the orphan results-data branch
results/
site/
history/
